[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6097844344","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124351#issuecomment-6097844344","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124351","id":6097844344,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABa3W4eA","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-10T13:10:31Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T13:11:10Z","body":"> However, the script's source_code property becomes empty. (This issue is only reproducible when the .pck file is exported with GDScript Export Mode set to Binary Tokens or Compressed binary tokens. Exporting the same .pck using Text mode works as expected.)\n\nThat's intended, the primary purpose of binary tokenization is to reduce file size. The raw source code is not available.\n\n---\n\nMounting a pck works on a virtual file system level. If you have loaded something into memory it does not automagically get updated. For resources you usually don't notice that because they are freed when they are not referenced anymore, so they will be reloaded from the underlying virtual file system the next time you use them. However `GDScript`s do have a static lifetime once loaded so changes to the VFS are irrelevant. You can try using `reload` to update the in memory version, but keep in mind that hot reloading is not supported in release builds. So this might fail if you still have lingering instances.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6097844344/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6098631126","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124351#issuecomment-6098631126","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124351","id":6098631126,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABa4G51g","user":{"login":"DonKoutsou","id":127870401,"node_id":"U_kgDOB58lwQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127870401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou","html_url":"https://github.com/DonKoutsou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonKoutsou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-10T14:38:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T14:38:53Z","body":"`reload` Does not seem to do anything in this current setup unfortunately.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6098631126/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]